{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-product","blocks":{"title":{"type":"title","settings":{}},"caption":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"{{ product.metafields.descriptors.subtitle.value }}","text_style":"subtitle"}},"8e29b3b3-eb8c-4755-aaec-d317609f4f19":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/yotpo-product-reviews\/blocks\/star-rating\/eb7dfd7d-db44-4334-bc49-c893b51b36cf","settings":{"product":"{{product}}"}},"price":{"type":"price","settings":{}},"description":{"type":"description","settings":{}},"variant_picker":{"type":"variant_picker","settings":{"picker_type":"button"}},"quantity_selector":{"type":"quantity_selector","settings":{}},"link_Qw9g6W":{"type":"link","settings":{"title":"{{ product.metafields.custom.link_to_title.value }}"}},"buy_buttons":{"type":"buy_buttons","settings":{"show_sticky_cart":true,"is_set":false,"only_tier_gang_button":"Required gang tier not reached","set_size":3,"set_text":"Wähle 3 Produkte","show_dynamic_checkout":false,"gang_url":"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/account\/login"}},"wishlist_engine_product_page_6abfcf":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/se-wishlist-engine\/blocks\/Product-Page\/8f7c0857-8e71-463d-a168-8e133094753b","disabled":true,"settings":{}},"6d5b98cf-5085-441e-8662-08829574072f":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/klarna-on-site-messaging\/blocks\/app-block\/b95936a9-74b6-4a95-8103-6a1b6459c25e","settings":{"data_key":"credit-promotion-badge","theme":"dark","topPadding":"0","bottomPadding":"0","messagePrefix":""}},"collapsible_tab_AYVP4Y":{"type":"collapsible_tab","disabled":true,"settings":{"heading":"Descriptions","icon":"clipboard","content":"<p>Meet O'Donnell Moonshine Lime. Zesty lime, cooling cucumber, bold grapefruit and rounding juniper all combine perfectly in this refreshing Moonshine that captures the taste of summer.<\/p><p>Clean, crisp, and endlessly mixable, O'Donnell Lime is made for sunny serves enjoyed in the garden with friends. Whether that's classic cocktails with a twist or simple mixes.<\/p><p>Perfect for everything from mouth-watering Mojitos to mind-blowing Margaritas, the possibilities with Lime are almost endless. Head over to our <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/blogs\/cocktails\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"cocktails recipes\">cocktails recipes<\/a> for more inspiration.<\/p><p>Bottled in traditional Mason Jars, we promise a unique drinking experience. If you would like to discover more <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/collections\/moonshine\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/collections\/moonshine\">high quality liqueurs<\/a>, have a look at our entire product range and become part of our <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/pages\/gang\" target=\"_blank\">Moonshine Gang<\/a> to collect proof points and get unique benefits.<\/p><p>Curious? Simply order your O'Donnell Lime today and we'll ship it to anywhere within mainland UK within a few working days.<br\/><br\/><strong>Please note: All of our products are shipped in branded boxes.<\/strong><\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_tab_nET7hx":{"type":"collapsible_tab","disabled":true,"settings":{"heading":"Perfect Serve","icon":"bottle","content":"<h4>Moonshine Mojito<\/h4><p><strong>Ingredients: <\/strong><\/p><ul><li><a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/products\/lime\">100ml Lime Moonshine <\/a><\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/products\/vodka?srsltid=AfmBOoq4fJT8XU8oo4tmBOJ8sA2_9D0Giz2pvtwg1zUzYKijtDf1xScN\">50ml O’Donnell Vodka <\/a><\/li><li>50ml Soda Water<\/li><li>12.5ml Sugar Syrup<\/li><li>Fresh Mint<\/li><li>Lime (Segment) <\/li><\/ul><p><strong>Method:<\/strong><\/p><ol><li>Muddle fresh mint and sugar syrup in a glass. <\/li><li>Once muddled, add ice to the glass and pour over the Vodka and Lime Moonshine. <\/li><li>Top with soda (to taste) and stir. <\/li><li>Garnish with fresh mint and\/or a slice of lime. <\/li><\/ol>","page":""}},"collapsible_tab_UXifNP":{"type":"collapsible_tab","disabled":true,"settings":{"heading":"Moonshine Must-Haves","icon":"check_mark","content":"<p>1. Your jar of <a href=\"\/collections\/moonshine\" title=\"Moonshine\">Moonshine<\/a>.<\/p><p>2. Our reusable <a href=\"\/products\/pouring-lid\" title=\"Pouring Lid\">Pouring Lid<\/a> to not waste a drop.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_tab_iPwypF":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Our Loyalty Scheme - The Gang","icon":"silhouette","content":"<p>Join our loyalty scheme 'The Gang' <a href=\"\/pages\/gang\" title=\"O'Donnell Gang\">here<\/a> to earn points, receive some amazing rewards and gain early access to exciting new products!<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_tab_9Vw9eH":{"type":"collapsible_tab","disabled":true,"settings":{"heading":"Allergens","icon":"gluten_free","content":"<p>All of our Moonshines, unless indicated otherwise, are allergen free in accordance with Regulation (EU) No 1169\/2011 and amendments.<\/p><p>All of our spirits are produced using wheat based alcohol. While the distillation process removes gluten from the final product, individuals with certain conditions (i.e coeliac disease) may wish to exercise caution prior to purchase.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-1":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Shipping","icon":"truck","content":"<p><strong>£3.95 <\/strong>for orders <strong>&lt; <\/strong>2kg<br\/><strong>£5.95 <\/strong>for orders <strong>&gt; <\/strong>2kg<\/p><p><strong>Free shipping<\/strong> for orders over £70!<\/p><p>Shipping cost to Northern Ireland is set at £16.95<\/p>","page":""}},"recommended_products_EmcFiq":{"type":"recommended_products","settings":{"title":"Upgrade your Summer!","content":"","button_text":"","product_list":["lime","peach","pomegranate","longdrink-glasses","metal-straws"],"enable_bulk_add":false,"columns_desktop":"2","enable_desktop_slider":true,"columns_mobile":"2","swipe_on_mobile":true}}},"block_order":["title","caption","8e29b3b3-eb8c-4755-aaec-d317609f4f19","price","description","variant_picker","quantity_selector","link_Qw9g